detects, pulls, and &#xD;
reconciles the VM CR. A leaf&#xD;
cert is created for the vmc instance&#xD;
if required.&#xD;
&#xD;
13. azlocal extension creates&#xD;
a rsa key pair.  The public key &#xD;
is patched onto the CR and pushed&#xD;
to the hc machine creates in step 2&#xD;
