&#xD;
12. mTLS certs are injected  via TLS encrypted RPC.&#xD;
&#xD;
14. EnableArcAgent gRPC API is invoked &#xD;
with the required config as args including&#xD;
the rsa private key from step 7.&#xD;
&#xD;
18. short lived TLS cert is rotated in exchange&#xD;
